      "text": "#thread in each state\nRUN: max #cores\nSLEEPING: any\nREADY: any\n\n1 READY: ? RUN\n   RUN: #cores\n1 READY: ? SLEEPING\n   ANY\n1 SLEEP:\n   ANY RUN\n   ANY READY\nCPU occupied\n    ANY READY\n    ANY SLEEPING",
